.TH J0 3  "May 12, 1986"
.UC 4
.SH NAME
j0, j1, jn, y0, y1, yn \- bessel functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.ft B
#include <math.h>

double
j0(\fIdouble x\fP)

double
j1(\fIdouble x\fP)

double
jn(\fIint n\fP, \fIdouble x\fP)

double
y0(\fI double x\fP)

double
y1(\fIdouble x\fP)

double
yn(\fIint n\fP, \fIdouble x\fP)
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
These functions calculate Bessel functions of the first
and second kinds for real arguments and integer orders.
.SH SEE ALSO
math(3)
